  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the ovoli mushroom pieces onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the Chinese five spice, smoked paprika, soy sauce, honey, garlic, and ginger to create the marinade.",
    "Brush the marinade onto both sides of the mushroom pieces.",
    "Brush the coconut oil onto the grill grates to prevent sticking.",
    "Place the skewers onto the grill and cook for 10 minutes, flipping halfway through.",
    "Deglaze the grill with sesame oil after flipping the skewers.",
    "Remove the skewers from the grill and sprinkle with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
